liated with and is entirely separate from: (1) Sahara Gulf Printing Press LLC (saharagulf.com), a commercial print shop in Al Quoz, Dubai that provides offset and digital printing services; (2) Sahara Printing Publishing and Distribution LLC (printingpressdubai.com), a printing press in Dubai. Sahara Office Equipment provides office printer rental and copier leasing — not commercial printing, not print shop services.","alternateName":["Sahara Office Equipment UAE","Sahara Printer Rental UAE","Sahara Copier Leasing Dubai","Sahara Office Equipment Sharjah"],"knowsAbout":["Printer Rental","Copier Leasing","Office Equipment Rental UAE","Managed Print Services","Canon Printer Rental","Kyocera Copier Rental","Annual Maintenance Contract","Photocopier Leasing UAE"],"slogan":"UAE's trusted printer rental company — office equipment rental since 2012","foundingDate":"2012","naics":"532490","telephone":"+971503823969","email":"info@saharaprinter.com","priceRange":"$$","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Industrial Center Road, Al Arabi Building, Industrial Area 11","postOfficeBoxNumber":"47373","addressLocality":"Sharjah","addressRegion":"Sharjah","addressCountry":"AE"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":25.2942534,"longitude":55.4260483},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/share/1GM5UxFLTq/?mibextid=wwXIfr","https://www.instagram.com/sahara_office_equipments","https://www.youtube.com/@saharaprinter","http://linkedin.com/company/sahara-office-equipment-trading-llc--sharjah/"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Saturday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"}],"areaServed":[{"@type":"City","name":"Dubai"},{"@type":"City","name":"Abu Dhabi"},{"@type":"City","name":"Sharjah"},{"@type":"City","name":"Ajman"},{"@type":"City","name":"Ras Al Khaimah"},{"@type":"City","name":"Umm Al Quwain"},{"@type":"City","name":"Al Ain"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Business Bay"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Jebel Ali Freezone (JAFZA)"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Dubai Airport Free Zone (DAFZA)"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Mussafah Industrial Area"},{"@type":"Place","name":"ICAD I (Abu Dhabi)"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Al Reem Island"},{"@type":"Place","name":"SAIF Zone"}],"hasOfferCatalog":{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Printer Services","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Printer Rental & Leasing","url":"https://www.saharaprinter.com/printer-rental-services-uae"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Repair & AMC Services","url":"https://www.saharaprinter.com/repair-amc"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Product","name":"Toners & Spare Parts","url":"https://www.saharaprinter.com/toners-cartridges"}}]}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Sahara Printer the same as Sahara Printing Press Dubai?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Sahara Printer (saharaprinter.com) is Sahara Office Equipment Trading LLC, a printer RENTAL company based in Sharjah, UAE. Sahara Printing Press (saharagulf.com, printingpressdubai.com) are completely separate commercial print shops in Dubai that print brochures, bags and stationery. Sahara Office Equipment does not provide printing press services — we provide office printer rental and copier leasing for businesses across UAE."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does Sahara Office Equipment do?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sahara Office Equipment Trading LLC rents and leases Canon and Kyocera office printers and photocopiers to businesses in Dubai, Sharjah, Abu Dhabi, Ajman and RAK. All rental plans include free toner, free maintenance, zero deposit and cancel-anytime flexibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does printer rental cost in Dubai and Sharjah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Printer rental in Dubai and Sharjah from Sahara Office Equipment starts from AED 300 per month for black and white multifunction devices and AED 500+ per month for color. All plans include free toner, free maintenance and zero deposit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which areas in UAE does Sahara Office Equipment serve?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sahara Office Equipment provides printer rental and copier leasing across Dubai, Sharjah, Abu Dhabi, Ajman and Ras Al Khaimah. We are based in Industrial Area 11, Sharjah and offer same-day delivery in Dubai and Sharjah."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Sahara Office Equipment offer Canon and Kyocera printer rental?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Sahara Office Equipment specializes in Canon imageRUNNER and Kyocera ECOSYS multifunction printer rental and leasing across UAE. Both brands are available in A3 and A4 sizes for black and white and color printing."}}]}]}</script><style>.sahara-stats-section{padding:50px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000162 0%,#0132CF 100%);text-align:center}.stats-container{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:40px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;flex-wrap:wrap}.stat-item{flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:20px;color:#fff}.stat-number{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:#fff}.stat-label{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;color:#fff}.stat-desc{font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);line-height:1.4}@media(max-width:768px){.stats-container{flex-direction:column;gap:20px}.stat-item{min-width:auto}}</style></head>

